    {
      "tag": "pr-782",
      "title": "feat: three-finger tap toggles Steam's on-screen keyboard in game mode",
      "summary": "\u2022 In Steam game mode, a quick three-finger tap sends Steam + X on the virtual pad, which opens Steam's on-screen keyboard; tapping again closes it.\n\u2022 New ThreeFingerTap detector: all three fingers must land within 250 ms, stay within slop, and lift within 350 ms of the third finger. Holds, swipes and four-finger touches don't fire.\n\u2022 Once the third finger lands, touches already sent to the game are cancelled and the rest of the gesture is withheld, so one- and two-finger input is unchanged. Works in both direct-touch and touchpad routing.\n\u2022 PadBridge's Steam + A QAM chord now takes any companion button; triggerSteamKeyboard() reuses it with X.",
